        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electric installation, 280 kWp photovoltaic plant, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electric installation, 280 kWp photovoltaic plant, at plant
Production of different components of the electric installation for a 280 kWp photovoltaic plant.\nTechnology: Electric installation\nVersion: 2.2\nEnergy values: Undefined\n100.0\nLocal category: Photovoltaik\nLocal subcategory: Herstellung Komponenten\nUVEK 2022 source file:174-photovoltaics-global-supply-chain-v2.5._X-electric-large.xml\n\n
UUID: c744fd02-807e-319f-9ed7-34753cbd40ec
Materials and packaging for the production of cabling and fuse box. Inverter ist not included. Estimation for metal processing. Disposal of the product after use.
Location: undefined
Technology: Electric installation
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: Air emissions of different pollutants are extrapolated from environmental reports. Extrapolation of European LCI inventory data by changing the consumed electricity mix to the Chinese electricity mix.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c744fd02-807e-319f-9ed7-34753cbd40ec.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
